    "content": "**Investigate:** [Agent fleet overview](/d/omni-agent-overview) \u00b7 [Trace Explorer](/d/omni-trace-explorer) \u00b7 [Session Explorer](/d/omni-session-explorer) \u00b7 [Agent Topology](/d/omni-agent-topology) \u00b7 [Evaluations](/d/omni-evaluations). Omni adds an AI investigation session (DevOps Agent) here; with this stack, follow the [runbooks](https://github.com/akashtalole/ai-observability/blob/main/docs/operations/runbooks.md) linked from each alert."
